<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
  <title>Invitation to Join [Syndicate’s Name] on Algoralign</title>
  <style>
    /* Retained global styles from original template */
    img {
      border: none;
      object-fit: contain;
      -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }
    .img-wrapper {
      width: 160px;
      height: 68px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #f6f6f6;
      font-family: sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .dao_container {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 650px;
      padding: 10px;
      width: 650px;
    }
    .main {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 3px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .wrapper {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    h3, h4 {
      color: #000000;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    p, ul, ol {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .dao a {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: solid 1px #2772f0;
      border-radius: 5px;
      color: #2772f0;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .dao-primary a {
      background-color: #2772f0;
      border-color: #2772f0;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="body">
    <tr>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td class="dao_container">
        <div class="content">
          <table role="presentation" class="main">
            <tr>
              <td class="wrapper">
                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      <div class="img-wrapper">
                        <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dfakuzuh2/image/upload/v1689410681/logo_cvkrer.png" alt="algoralign">
                      </div>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      <h3>Dear <strong>{{founder_name}}</strong>,</h3>
                      <p>We are pleased to inform you that <strong>{{syndicate_name}}</strong> has invited your startup, <strong>{{startup_name}}</strong>, to participate in a funding opportunity on Algoralign.</p>
                      <h4><strong>Next Steps:</strong></h4>
                      <ol>
                        <li>Complete Your Startup Profile – Provide key details about your company.</li>
                        <li>Submit KYC & Banking Details – Ensure seamless disbursement.</li>
                        <li>Review & Accept Investment Terms – Carefully examine the deal structure.</li>
                      </ol>

                      <p>To get started, click below to accept your invitation and set up your profile.</p>

                      <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="dao dao-primary">
                        <tr>
                          <td align="left">
                            <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                              <tr>
                                <td>
                                  <a href="{{accept_invitation_link}}" target="_blank">Accept Invitation & Set Up Your Profile</a>
                                </td>
                              </tr>
                            </table>
                          </td>
                        </tr>
                      </table>

                      <p>If you already have an Algoralign account, simply <a href="{{login_link}}" style="color: #2772f0; font-weight: bold;">log in</a> to view and respond to the deal invitation.</p>

                      <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to us at <a href="mailto:support@algoralign.com">support@algoralign.com</a>.</p>
                      <p>We look forward to seeing your startup thrive with the support of the <strong>{{syndicate_name}}</strong> investor community.</p>
                      <p>Best regards,</p>
                      <p>The Algoralign Team</p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <div class="footer">
            <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
              <tr>
                <td class="content-block">
                  <span class="apple-link">Address details</span><br>
                  Don't like these emails? <a href="#">Unsubscribe</a>.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="content-block powered-by">
                  Powered by <a href="#">Algoralign</a>.
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
